ame by and empty the contents  into a wagon where it was delivered to  concrete tanks to recover the saltpeter  during the Civil War in the u.s. while  the men of the South were off fighting  the women were doing their part by  collecting their urine a contribution  immortalized in poems what could make a  Yankee soldier sadder than dodging  bullets fired by a pretty woman's  bladder and as always thanks for  watching
 

